        Warranties\n<color=#ABABAB><size=52><align=\"left\">\n<color=#FFFFFF>2.1.
        \n<color=#ABABAB>Transferor represents and warrants that:\n\na. Transferor
        has full right and authority to transfer the Soul;\nb. The Soul is free and
        clear of any encumbrances, liens, or third-party claims;\nc. The Soul has
        not been previously sold, pledged, or otherwise encumbered.\n\n<color=#FFFFFF>2.2.\n<color=#ABABAB>Transferee
